    "body": "## Motivation\n\nFixes #43148\n\nWhen `<tool_call>` starts mid-chunk, `HermesDetector.parse_streaming_increment` returns the text before it directly. Every other normal-text path goes through `_clean_normal_text`, which drains `_normal_text_buffer`, so text held back as a possible `</tool_call>` comes out after the tool call. The same branch leaks `</tool_call>` into the content when one parallel call ends and the next starts in one delta:\n\n```\n                 before                              after\nissue repro      ['a', 'b', '', '', '</done']        ['a', '</b', '', '', 'done']\nparallel calls   ['', '', '', '</tool_call>\\n', '']   ['', '', '', '\\n', '']\n```\n\n## Modifications\n\n- Route that branch through `_clean_normal_text`, as suggested in the issue.\n- Two streaming tests in `test_hermes_detector.py`, one per symptom. Both fail on `main`.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nParser-only change, no model output involved.\n\n```\npytest test/registered/unit/function_call/test_hermes_detector.py    # 14 passed\npytest test/registered/unit/function_call                            # 631 passed\npre-commit run --files python/sglang/srt/function_call/hermes_detector.py test/registered/unit/function_call/test_hermes_detector.py\n```\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNot affected.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format your code according to the Format code with pre-commit.\n- [x] Add unit tests according to the Run and add unit tests.\n- [ ] Update documentation (not needed)\n- [ ] Provide accuracy and speed benchmark results (not applicable)\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style guidance.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #38853166139](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38853166139)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38853148298](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38853148298)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #38853148247](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38853148247)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
